COIP 2014-2026, 50 versions: every applied version's wording is cut from the text layer of the Registro Oficial edition of the Code (Supl. 180, 2014) or of the amending act or ruling (no OCR, no consolidation text); 22 acts and rulings whose gazette edition is image-only (or whose struck words come from one) are NOT applied, and 5 later acts' partial amendments of 11 provisions they left out of date are not applied either, all marked in their commits and decisions; reforms indexed to 7-VIII-2026 (Ediciones Legales 2026, Andina 2026, Asamblea list screened by text layer), image-only laws after 24-VIII-2026 unchecked (stated in decisions); versions to 4-I-2023 unchanged; test build with corpus.json + all parts: check.py 0 mismatches, --compare identical (2026-10-28).
